                {
                    "id": "critical_question",
                    "topic": "limitations",
                    "basis": "interpretation",
                    "text": "computeRatio的roe/roa/利润率已乘100，index再以percent=true调用formatNumber乘100；例如10/100应表达10%，这条路径会显示1000%。projectPlan默认steps=12并令total=min(periods,steps)，years>1的月度计划仍只累计12期却标完整年数；index未暴露steps覆盖。portfolio targets/values声明additionalProperties:false却无已声明资产键，也需宿主schema验收。",
                    "evidence_ids": [
                        "2026-10-21-03-github-1336663504-root-source"
